// Date: 2020-05-26
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036.005
// Description: Detects the creation of an executable with a system process name in folders other than the system ones (System32, SysWOW64, etc.).
// It is highly recommended to perform an initial baseline before using this rule in production.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

